      "title": "完整调用链(源码核实)",
      "items": [
        "SYSCALL_DEFINE3(read) — fs/read_write.c:723",
        "ksys_read — fs/read_write.c:705",
        "vfs_read — fs/read_write.c:554",
        "f_op->read_iter — fs/read_write.c:493",
