        "submit_bio—block/blk-core.c:960"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "深读要点",
      "items": [
        "VFS 只做权限/边界校验，实际读由 file->f_op->read_iter 分派到 ext4",
        "页缓存命中时 filemap_get_read_batch 直接取 folio 并拷贝到用户缓冲区",
        "未命中时经 a_ops->read_folio 回调 ext4，ext4_mpage_readpages 组装 bio",
        "bio 经 submit_bio → submit_bio_noacct → blk_mq_submit_bio 进入块层",
        "完成回调 mpage_end_io → folio_end_read 唤醒等待者后拷贝返回"
      ]
    }
  ]
